  "colors": "UR",
  "identity": "A blue-red engine deck built on Horseshoe Crab's '{U}: Untap this creature'. Attach a tap-ability Aura to the Crab and every blue mana becomes one point of damage: Hermetic Study grants '{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target', Quicksilver Dagger grants the same at a player plus a card. High Tide, Frantic Search, Cloud of Faeries and Peregrine Drake multiply how many blue mana exist in a single turn, so an assembled board converts a normal turn into a lethal burst. Because Horseshoe Crab is a 2-of with no functional redundancy in this cube, the list is built to win without it too: Thieving Magpie and Cloud of Faeries are evasive Aura hosts, Grim Lavamancer is an independent repeating damage source, and Counterspell / Force of Will protect whichever half landed first.",
